meta {
  name: SetCredential — the response carries no value
  type: grpc
  seq: 1
}

grpc {
  url: {{bffGrpc}}
  method: /dop.bff.v1.ResourceService/SetCredential
  body: grpc
  auth: none
}

metadata {
  authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
  x-account-id: {{accountId}}
}

body:grpc {
  [
    {
      "resource_id": "{{integrationId}}",
      "secret": "Z2hwX2V4ZW1wbG8tZGUtdG9rZW4="
    }
  ]
}

docs {
  It returns the RESOURCE, not the bare reference: the cockpit needs to show
  "credential configured" without a second trip to the server.

  And it returns it **without the value** — `credential_ref` is an opaque label.
  There is no RPC to read the secret in this contract, and there must not come to
  be one.
}
